This directory holds the compiled frontend bundle produced by `npm run build`
(see `esbuild.mjs` and `frontend/email-editor.js`).

The bundle is a build artifact and is git-ignored; this `.gitkeep` commits the
directory itself so `manage.py check` (which hard-fails with staticfiles.E002
when a `STATICFILES_DIRS` entry missing) stays green in fresh checkouts and CI.

`build.sh` runs `npm run build` before `collectstatic`, so production is fine
too.